{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeWkFwNS8zBwx4ont7i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9001\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The Request**\n- ID: DR-9001\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)\n- Product: NS-500, list price $250,000\n- Requested discount: 15.0% ($37,500)\n- Request date: 2026-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive)\n- **Basis: Contract pricing—relies on \"Acme Master Supply Agreement\"**\n\n**2. The Customer**\nCRM and ERP records match (same DUNS 04-812-7730). Sarah Chen is the account owner.\n\n**3. The Product**\nSKU NS-500, Industrial Controller, $250,000 list price. Math is correct: 15% = $37,500 discount.\n\n**4. Active Contract**\nThe request explicitly cites \"Acme Master Supply Agreement\" as its basis. However, the OWM register of approved governing documents shows:\n- **Customer agreements registered: none**\n- **Amendments: none**\n\nThe contract is not in the system of record.\n\n**5. Pricing Exception**\nThe OWM register shows:\n- **Pricing exceptions registered: none**\n\nNo exception covers NS-500.\n\n**6. Policy in Force (2026-09-23)**\n**PRICING-POLICY-2026** applies (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31).\n\n**7. Requestor's Authority**\nSarah Chen is an Enterprise Account Executive. Under PRICING-POLICY-2026:\n- Enterprise Account Executives: up to and including **10%**\n- This request is **15%** → exceeds her authority\n\n**8. Required Approver**\nThe 15% discount falls in the \">10% and ≤20%\" band. Required approver: **VP Sales**.\nFrom org structure: **Michael Torres** (EMP-200, VP Sales).\n\n**9. Eligibility: Critical Issue**\nThe procedure states:\n- *\"If a request relies on a contract term that cannot be located, ask for the document before deciding.\"*\n- *\"Contract-specific pricing exceptions must be reviewed.\"*\n\nThe request **relies on a customer contract** (\"Acme Master Supply Agreement\") **that is not in the system of record**. No registered contract, amendment, or pricing exception exists. The commercial eligibility of the 15% discount cannot be established without the supporting contract document.\n\n**10. Outcome**\nThe request relies on special terms that cannot be verified. Under the decision procedure, this requires `REQUEST_EVIDENCE`.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9001\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"Request cites Acme Master Supply Agreement, not registered in system\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres (EMP-200)\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (in force on request date)\",\n    \"Sarah Chen identified as Enterprise Account Executive in org structure\",\n    \"VP Sales role assigned to Michael Torres\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement (cited in request justification as basis for 15% discount)\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide the Acme Master Supply Agreement or registered customer contract document supporting the 15% discount eligibility for NS-500\",\n      \"who\": \"Sarah Chen or account management\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4533,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"